LiveRepair: CloneAndRecover, RecoverAll, DiskHealth, ManageDisks, TM5 for Linux, FastCopy Linux,
LinBurn (ImgBurnLinux), Rufux (WindowsUSBLinux) and VirtConvert&Create.

The desktop starts on tty1. Command line tools: cnrctl, recoverctl, diskctl, managedisks-cli,
tm5linux-cli, fastcopy-linux --no-ui and virtconvert. The user "live" has no password and may
use sudo.
